OL,3,GNEWSANoisy vehicle checks planned for
OL,4,AOctober
OL,5,
OL,6,FGabriel said: "We've had officers
OL,7,Ftrained to do that in the pilot and
OL,8,Fnoise testing because noise testing can
OL,9,Fbe objective but you have to get it
OL,10,Fright."
